  "decisionTrail": "/tmp/ask-ai-jira-decisions.tsv",
  "implementation": [
    "One generated ChatRequestIntent union replaces refine/retry request booleans and all internal callers. Message, RefineRecord, DraftJira, QuestionReply and Retry are distinct.",
    "V2 whole completed-response contract extends the existing parser; legacy V1 contracts remain readable and retryable. Additive schema 18 leaves 16/17 schema modules unchanged.",
    "Generic question/answer metadata is persisted under app-owned message identity. There is no Jira draft aggregate, catalog, reducer, client, provider-native question bridge, hidden choice value or parser callback.",
    "Core resolution is shared by preflight, recheck and transactional start. Direct replies send exact normalized visible text with no images; exact trimmed case-sensitive typed correlation uses the immutable original snapshot. Mismatches keep ordinary Send with current context.",
    "Transcript order expires choices on every later user turn. Empty composer/image/work/failure guards retain input. Finding subtask has an optional display-only Recommended badge for Finding sources; no preselection.",
    "All destination, project, parent, actual type and required-field choices remain conversational agent reports. Drafting instructions ask for content first and one missing detail at a time through existing configured tools.",
    "Prepare action message fills and focuses an editable persisted composer. User Send and existing tool permissions govern any subsequent action. Explicit Retry warns about repeated tool effects. No automatic resend, remote recovery state or app-verified Jira success was added.",
    "P2 fixed in generalized completion. Rejected plain/malformed output is retained as inert text, complete rejected envelopes retain their readable Markdown, and a separate bounded warning creates no control. No warning prefix can overflow an exact 16 KiB response. Note/replay retain readable questions and replies.",
    "Shared chat model selection, images, cancellation, permissions, Note handoff and R1 guarded Apply/Save/Undo remain on their existing controllers. The send capability was extracted to stay below 500 lines."
  ],
